Hi Wes
I think you're confusing occasions (times) and sessions. Try sessioncov = data.frame(ab=c('a', 'b', 'b', 'b', 'b'). I don't see where 'c' comes in. Set the newdata argument in predict to get estimates for levels other than the base levels. e.g.
predict(secrmodel, newdata = data.frame(ab = c('a','b')))
Murray

